# Wave W17-Q (Route 121): warden pine — a shoulder pine in warm greens, tiered and sturdy under the mountain, highlight lifted clear of the turf, on warden turf (ground baked in). Route 121’s own tree — warmer and broader in the crown than Route 120’s cold ledger pine: the warden’s pine stands in the mountain’s lee, the ledger pine stands in the weather.
